@startuml Pay Reservation Sequence

actor User
participant UI
participant ReservationController
participant ReservationService
participant "PaymentGateway\n<<external>>" as PaymentGateway
participant ReservationRepository
participant PaymentRepository
database DB

User -> UI: Select reservation
User -> UI: Request payment

UI -> ReservationController: POST /reservations/{id}/confirm
activate ReservationController

ReservationController -> ReservationService: confirm(id)
activate ReservationService

ReservationService -> ReservationRepository: findById(id)
activate ReservationRepository

ReservationRepository -> DB: SELECT reservation by ID
DB --> ReservationRepository: reservation row / empty

ReservationRepository --> ReservationService: Optional<Reservation>
deactivate ReservationRepository

alt Reservation does not exist
    ReservationService --> ReservationController: ResourceNotFoundException
    ReservationController --> UI: 404 Not Found
    UI --> User: Display payment rejected

else Reservation is not PENDING
    ReservationService --> ReservationController: IllegalStateException
    ReservationController --> UI: 409 Conflict
    UI --> User: Display payment rejected

else Reservation expired (createdAt + 5 min <= now)

    ReservationService -> ReservationRepository: delete(reservation)
    activate ReservationRepository

    ReservationRepository -> DB: DELETE reservation
    note right of DB: Seats of the reservation\nbecome FREE
    DB --> ReservationRepository: deleted

    ReservationRepository --> ReservationService: void
    deactivate ReservationRepository

    ReservationService --> ReservationController: IllegalStateException\nReservation expired
    ReservationController --> UI: 409 Conflict
    UI --> User: Display payment rejected\n(reservation expired)

else Reservation is valid

    ReservationService -> PaymentGateway: processPayment(payment)
    activate PaymentGateway
    PaymentGateway --> ReservationService: payment result
    deactivate PaymentGateway

    alt Payment failed
        ReservationService --> ReservationController: PaymentFailedException
        ReservationController --> UI: 402 Payment Required
        UI --> User: Display payment rejected

    else Payment successful

        ReservationService -> ReservationService: reservation.status = RESERVED\npayment.status = COMPLETED

        ReservationService -> ReservationRepository: save(reservation)
        activate ReservationRepository

        ReservationRepository -> DB: UPDATE reservation
        note right of DB: Seats of the reservation\nbecome RESERVED
        DB --> ReservationRepository: updated row

        ReservationRepository --> ReservationService: saved Reservation
        deactivate ReservationRepository

        ReservationService -> PaymentRepository: save(payment)
        activate PaymentRepository

        PaymentRepository -> DB: UPDATE payment
        DB --> PaymentRepository: updated row

        PaymentRepository --> ReservationService: saved Payment
        deactivate PaymentRepository

        ReservationService -> ReservationService: Map Reservation -> ReservationDto

        ReservationService --> ReservationController: ReservationDto
        ReservationController --> UI: 200 OK\nReservationDto
        UI --> User: Display payment result\n(reservation confirmed)
    end

end

deactivate ReservationService
deactivate ReservationController

@enduml
